# Tooling working material -- kept in the working tree, never published. Same rule
# as plans/ and learning/: the records these produce are published, the scaffolding
# that produced them is not. PRODUCT.md and DESIGN.md live at the repo root and are
# versioned; the surface brief, the design sidecar, the review screenshots and the
# machine-local config stay here.
.claude/
.impeccable/

